  "schema:name": "Report Suspected SF Product (SF-REP-001)",
  "schema:description": "Enable health care professionals to promptly identify anomalies, isolate the suspect product, capture product, batch, expiry, photo, and incident details (online or offline with synchronization), and submit a suspected substandard or falsified medical product report to the NMRA. (Table 10, Fig. 4, Table 9, Table 12, PDF 39-43)",
